e/godot/pulls/108504","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108504","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108504.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108504.patch","merged_at":"2025-09-18T17:50:28Z"},"body":"I was poking around the Alloc > Duplicate benchmark and noticed that there's an unnecessary copy happening in `ClassDB::get_property_list`. `validate_property` must be run on a copy of the `PropertyInfo`, but a copy has to be made during `push_back` anyways, so we can rearrange things a bit and only perform one copy instead of two.\r\n\r\nI ran the Alloc > Duplicate benchmark nine times for each and dropped the top two and bottom two of each:\r\n```\r\noptimize-duplicate\r\n------------------------------\r\nRunning benchmark: C++/Alloc/duplicate\r\nResult: {\"time\":4387.0}\r\nResult: {\"time\":4422.0}\r\nResult: {\"time\":4426.0}\r\nResult: {\"time\":4432.0}\r\nResult: {\"time\":4443.0}\r\n\r\nmaster\r\n------------------------------\r\nRunning benchmark: C++/Alloc/duplicate\r\nResult: {\"time\":4704.0}\r\nResult: {\"time\":4710.0}\r\nResult: {\"time\":4730.0}\r\nResult: {\"time\":4736.0}\r\nResult: {\"time\":4764.0}\r\n```\r\n\r\nIt's only a ~6.5% speedup, but it's a pretty core function so it seemed worth a PR.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.co